## Explicit non-goals

* Do not turn the post into an LM Studio / GGUF / M3 Max tutorial.
* Do not drop the hypr/vLLM/Hyperstack narrative or the cost math.
* Do not invent tool-call or reasoning-off results — only add Phase B/C from real sessions.
* Do not duplicate the memo's model list; keep the hypr preset list as source of truth.
* De-LLM any new prose per blog-writing-style when those sections are written.
* Response speed degrading as conversations lengthen (KV growth / decode feel over long threads): out of scope unless a lived observation is ready; optional one-liner near context/KV if writing from memory.
* Autocomplete / IDE completion vs agentic viability: this post is about agentic coding with pi; do not expand into local autocomplete product comparisons.
* Harness / local-provider integratability beyond pi: stay on pi + vLLM OpenAI-compatible API; do not survey OpenCode, Continue, etc. unless actually tried.

## Done-for-this-task

This file is the gap analysis and inclusion plan. Implementing Phases A–C is follow-up work on the draft itself (separate task or later edit pass).
